  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two manifests per module",
      "items": [
        "module.ts (defineModule): texts, error tags and describer, note types, routes, sections, services, commands",
        "screens.ts (ModuleScreens): screens, section parts, context area; Vue-free",
        "A new module edits two shared places: APP_MODULES and MODULE_SCREENS"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Composition",
      "items": [
        "The root files derive every composed type and value from APP_MODULES",
        "MODULE_SCREENS is keyed by the module names: a module without screens does not compile",
        "The shell adds the frame's settings entry on the first section"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Late loading",
      "items": [
        "Plugin load evaluates no Vue: appSurface and every screens.ts only hold import() loaders",
        "Vue, Nuxt UI and the components load when a ShellView opens"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Direction and enforcement",
      "items": [
        "feature → notes → shell, through each index.ts; every layer imports the domain",
        "ESLint reads APP_MODULES; configs/fallow.json is generated from it",
        "communities has no infrastructure folder: notes go through NoteStore"
      ]
    }
  ]
